 "about": "Which art mesh draws each catalogue id of props.json (docs/unreal/spec/05b-props), read by Content/Python/build_block.py. One entry per id: 'meshes' are picked by the instance seed (index = seed mod count; 'byVariant' picks by shapeVariant instead), 'variants' override the entry for an instance's props.json variant, 'paint' names the slot that takes the instance's paint colour (props.json instances[].paint, a clear-coat car paint), 'parts' are further meshes placed in the same frame as the first ('at' and 'yaw' relative to its pivot, Unreal cm and degrees). 'gameplay' ids are drawn by the gameplay actors (AMIExplosive, AMIReelCase, AMITruck from presentation.json), never by the level. Ids without an entry keep their props.json box. Mesh names are the art manifest's (art/out/manifest.json, art/blender/README.md).",
